WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:06.550
At one time, gods and demons were as one.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:10.220
They were sealed away in the abyss of distant memory.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.960
The hearts of humans in fear of the Dark caused this.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.360
For the present, let us call these beings "Shinma".

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.360
<i>Shinma: Japanese for “Gods-Demons”</i>

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:22.790
Now they've awakened and gathered in the Dark.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.610
The final night of the gathering, when Shinma and humans met again,

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.470
a young girl entered their midst. This is her story. Her name is...

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:43.800
Vampire Princess Miyu

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.600
<i>If Kyoto is the old capital of the Kansai area,</i>

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.600
<i>Kansai: Western Japan</i>

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:01.250
<i>then this, Kamakura, could be called the old capital of the Kanto area.</i>

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:01.250
<i>Kanto: Eastern Japan</i>

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:09.350
<i>On a whim I visited this town in which I’d lived briefly as a girl.</i>

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:27.640
<i>This hill... no mistake, it was this hill.</i>

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.790
<i>It clings to the back of my mind, and won't let go.</i>

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:37.030
<i>It clings to the back of my mind, and won’t let go.</i>

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:27.630
<i>When I came to, I was in my own bed.</i>

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:30.760
<i>I’d always thought it was just a dream...</i>

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:34.630
<i>But if my memory is true,</i>

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:40.470
<i>there was a house atop this hill.</i>

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:29.390
Episode 4
Frozen Time

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.260
Miyu!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.010
What is that?

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.730
I was right... you can see them.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:06.950
Ice? Glass? Is the room filled with glass?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:14.760
As a kid, I saw something horrific, probably here...

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:21.460
It was Shinma, right?! I thought I'd find you if I came here...

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.300
Why do you chase me?

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:28.180
I will not let you get away with taking blood from the living!

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:36.460
I need blood, just as you need to breathe air and eat food...

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.150
...and I grant eternity.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.070
Do you not want eternal life too?

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:45.500
Don't mock me!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:47.860
You...

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.830
Himiko... now I see.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.750
So that's it...

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.500
Cut that out!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:02.720
You know... Some people go unaffected...

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.210
at the time their blood is drunk.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.910
They grow up, then, at some point...

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.930
their blood will awaken, the same blood as mine.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:14.750
There are those of my kind among humans as well.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:17.950
A kind that wouldn't exist if not for you!

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:23.020
Poor thing. You limit your own comprehension of the world,

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:29.950
as if desperately insisting that you're human...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.110
Well then, what are you?

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:37.790
Well, you'll forget anyway... so I guess it's all right.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:44.630
Those are my parents. I used to live here.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:51.750
Ouch! Why, you...

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.770
Miyu! Dinner's ready!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.200
Okay!

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:06.270
Today, the teacher asked us to write about our families.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:12.890
I felt bad 'cause Daddy's always home, unlike other daddies.

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:13.660
That's all right.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.160
Your father inherited this house from your grandfather...

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.120
and it is his job to take care of it.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:20.860
I guess...

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:23.580
What happened to your finger, Miyu?

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:24.960
Huh?!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:31.150
Pipi pecked me... it's not bleeding.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.800
Fine then... forget it.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.370
Say, Mum?

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:40.610
Yes, dear?

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:43.800
Do you think Daddy likes me?

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:50.850
Why... your father and I both adore you.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:52.690
Okay!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:08:02.870
Daddy? Emi and Ai said they want to be artists when they grow up!

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:06.290
And Akiko wants to be a teacher!

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:15.380
Daddy, you like pictures, right? I want to be an artist, too.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.600
You can't.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:18.510
Why not?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:22.140
Even when you grow up, you can't be anything.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.440
It's... been decided.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.310
Why? Tell me...

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:38.780
Daddy...

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.230
Where's Mummy?

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.710
I don't know.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:48.130
— Did you buy another painting?
— Yes.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:54.050
Pictures are wonderful. They can entrap beauty forever.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:02.720
True... but to me the ocean's beautiful because it's always moving...

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.980
beautiful because it changes from moment to moment.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.700
Mother!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.320
You were late coming home today.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:18.860
Yes... I was watching the ocean. At night it's kind of... scary,

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:20.660
as if I'd be swept away...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.240
Miyu?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.910
I'm sorry! I'll come straight home from now on.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.280
Dear?

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.840
I'd hoped for this.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:34.270
How old is Miyu now?

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.230
Thirteen.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:37.760
I see...

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:44.680
It was a dream... just a dream. Miyu, forget it...

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:50.000
I must forget it! Let me forget it!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.870
What happened? What is it?

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.170
Is something wrong? What!

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:58.440
Someone's passed out!

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:01.040
Somebody get her teacher! I'm scared!

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.510
It was so sudden... what could have happened?

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:05.580
Who's her teacher? Which class is she in?

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.960
I don't know.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.350
Hey, what do you think happened?

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:24.260
Hmmm... do you know something?

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:29.450
I don't know... I don't know anything.

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:36.660
Larva!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:38.450
Larva...

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:46.290
Where are you, Larva? Why?

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:52.210
Why's this happening? I don't want any blood... I want none of this...

00:10:55.110 --> 00:11:01.550
I thought she looked pretty... and then my body acted on its own.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:07.340
What's happening to me? I don't want to become a vampire...

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:12.160
But... I thirst...

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.280
That was good.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.870
Miyu, are you done?

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:21.820
Uh-huh...

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:26.700
I heard that something awful happened at school today...

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.430
They said it was anaemia.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.670
She fainted and was taken away in an ambulance.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.880
I heard she passed away...

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.240
Really?

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:39.350
Did you know her?

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.200
No.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.800
I see...

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:51.790
I wonder if Mother knows? Or maybe...

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:55.430
No one must ever find out.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:04.610
I have a reflection... I'm not afraid.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:09.100
But there are times when I want blood so badly...

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.640
No! I won't drink blood again.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.730
I've made up my mind... I've made up my mind...

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:19.480
She's not figured it out yet?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.890
Surely, she must have realized by now.

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.420
No...

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:28.480
The time of change is approaching.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:31.370
Not yet... She's not ready yet.

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.100
<i>Mother...</i>

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.570
What's wrong?

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.660
I guess you're scared too...

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.410
Ouch!

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:54.740
Blood... my blood. The same as human blood... it's the same, right?

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.300
Are they gone?

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:04.310
Yes... Dear, I want to talk about Miyu.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.340
Can't it wait until later?

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.720
Later?

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.820
I have time... An eternity.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:16.900
Wow! What a gorgeous garden. Tending it must be hard work.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.810
— What's the matter?
— Huh?

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:22.740
Maybe I shouldn't come to play, unannounced... Huh?

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.820
No... I'm glad you're here...

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.240
Great!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.050
Say, wanna come in for some tea?

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:33.210
Well, actually, I came today to ask a favour.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.610
What is it?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.530
Have you ever thought about death?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:45.150
These days, I do... a lot.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:48.340
You know, watching the news about wars and stuff?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:53.510
I don't want to die yet... There are so many things I want to do.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:56.140
But you never know when you're gonna die.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.060
Nobody knows...

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.950
I saw it...

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:05.860
That day...

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:16.300
Vampires can grant eternal life to those they drink from, right?

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:17.870
A body never aging...

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.800
Hey! What're you talking about?

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.840
Vampires are kinda romantic, don't you think?

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:23.840
Stop it...

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.610
It's okay.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.720
Come on... drink and give me what I want!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:34.310
I said stop it! Because I'm not a vampire, I'm human.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.390
But you drank her blood, didn't you?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:41.310
She's dead, that girl.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.730
Please... stop it...

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.070
Akiko...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.250
Miyu... you're not... serious, are you?

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.170
Wait... wait a second!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.990
You knew, Mother.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:36.870
You knew it all... Are you a vampire, Mother? Is that why I...

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:38.910
You are human!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:44.180
I am not! This thirst... how can I quench this thirst?

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.790
I don't want any more blood...

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:48.710
Mother?!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:55.640
Drink, Miyu... but this is the last time, because you're human...

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.060
No! I won't drink it!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:02.480
If you don't, someone will die at school tomorrow.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.570
No!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.200
Mother! Where is Akiko?!

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.350
I sent her home.

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:16.700
You're lying!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:20.210
This is Akiko's blood, isn't it?

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:26.110
Did you kill Akiko? You did, didn't you, Mother?

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:32.760
I don't want it... Take it away!

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.090
They've come...

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.600
She's not yet... She's...

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:36.280
What... what is this?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.240
The time has come...

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:41.120
What "time"?

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:46.540
They are Shinma... just as we are.

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.960
"Shin... ma?"

00:17:52.350 --> 00:17:58.150
We, once called gods and demons, chose to relinquish the earth...

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:00.800
to humans, to dwell in the lowest depths of the Dark.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:05.730
One, and only one, bloodline was left on Earth...

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:11.010
to make sure that the sleep of our kin, hidden in the Dark, wasn't disturbed.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.650
Mother!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:20.530
Those guardians left on the surface... We are those guardians, Miyu.

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:22.940
"Guardians..."

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:28.550
You must obey your blood's call and become guardian.

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:32.840
Tonight is when the Dark and the Shinma come together.

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:36.800
What're you talking about, Mother? What do you mean?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:45.100
Right. Tonight, you'll be recognized as Shinma.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.640
I'm not Shinma...

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:52.020
Didn't it taste wonderful...
the blood of that virgin{, that is}?

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:57.490
Your body and fangs won't easily forget that ecstasy.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:04.870
Your clan is not immortal and unaging. You will grow old... grow old and die.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.290
Because we're human.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:12.620
That is why a change of guardian is necessary.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:17.260
But as compensation, you have been released...

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.910
from all of the vampire's restrictions.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:24.640
You also possess the power to give eternal life to humans.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:29.710
It is not to steal human life, but to give it to them.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.810
— That is what Shinma are!
— No!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:36.740
Come, and receive our baptism.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:39.900
Mother...

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:48.410
Mother?!

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.830
Do you want to end the guardians' bloodline?!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.250
Miyu! Run!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.260
Larva!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:08.180
You! Are you of the clan that defied us and went astray?

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:13.150
Mother! What about Father and Larva?!

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.060
We won't let you escape!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.120
Run, Miyu! Run!

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:25.410
Why save me?

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:29.400
— I'm your mother.
— But...

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:32.310
Miyu, you're human...

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.330
I won't let anyone say otherwise.

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:44.060
It's no good... water doesn't help. I'm still thirsty. Please, help...

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:49.450
Miyu, I'll protect you, so promise you won't drink blood again...

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:54.100
I don't want to do it... but people will want me to...

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:59.020
Yes! All humans want to live forever! Right?!

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:03.540
Miyu... before you said that the ocean,

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:07.590
changing from moment to moment, is beautiful, right?

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:12.950
People are the same. It's because there is death that life is wonderful.

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:19.880
Because I loved that man... I gave him eternal life.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:22.210
Father?

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:29.090
Miyu, we... we ourselves can't live forever.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:31.800
He has no spirit because he will not know death.

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:32.640
Miyu, surely you know that.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:38.740
His lack of vigour... how he seems not to know what to live for...

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:41.570
a man always out of touch with reality.

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:46.850
The more I love him, the more I suffer from my mistake.

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:52.550
We mean to give happiness but cause misery instead.

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:54.040
Mother...

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:59.330
I'll help you avoid this fate, even if it costs me my life.

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:08.640
Don't worry. I will always be with you... But you must choose your own path.

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:11.470
They're coming!

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:21.400
Mother... what do I do? My throat...

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:25.110
My throat...

00:22:27.550 --> 00:22:28.520
I can't...

00:22:28.520 --> 00:22:29.820
Miyu!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:33.560
Miyu!

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:39.500
Mother...

00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:45.940
Miyu... I love you. Hang on, please...

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:51.260
I... may not be able... to choose...

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:54.180
Miyu...

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:01.620
Miyu...

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:04.970
Darling...

00:23:24.350 --> 00:23:25.790
Miyu...

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:40.810
This blood...

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:50.490
Mother...

00:23:54.810 --> 00:23:56.820
Mother...

00:24:21.650 --> 00:24:26.650
My parents weren't dead, but they were sealed away...

00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:31.530
They gave me a condition for releasing the seal:

00:24:32.420 --> 00:24:36.150
If I returned the stray Shinma that had used our escape...

00:24:36.150 --> 00:24:40.460
to break out of the Dark, they'd release the seal.

00:24:40.460 --> 00:24:44.460
For this task, time has been stopped for me as well,

00:24:45.690 --> 00:24:49.380
so that I accomplish the task, even if it takes centuries...

00:24:50.100 --> 00:24:52.650
Even though when the seal is released,

00:24:52.650 --> 00:24:55.470
you'll formally become that... guardian?

00:24:55.470 --> 00:24:58.590
There's just one thing I want to say...

00:25:00.280 --> 00:25:01.220
to my mother...

00:25:02.100 --> 00:25:03.390
What?

00:25:08.890 --> 00:25:09.480
Miyu!

00:25:13.920 --> 00:25:15.330
Miyu!

00:25:30.070 --> 00:25:32.240
<i>Oh, no... what was I doing?</i>

00:25:35.710 --> 00:25:41.890
<i>Oh yeah... I came to confirm my dream. If my memory’s right...</i>

00:25:42.160 --> 00:25:46.360
<i>...that mansion would be up here...</i>

00:25:49.100 --> 00:25:50.060
<i>As I suspected...</i>

00:25:52.050 --> 00:25:55.370
<i>Some people go unaffected at the time their blood is drunk.</i>

00:25:55.370 --> 00:25:57.090
<i>They grow up, then, at some point,</i>

00:25:57.090 --> 00:25:59.600
<i>their blood will awaken...</i>

00:26:01.090 --> 00:26:01.580
Who's there?

00:26:06.070 --> 00:26:09.920
No, I didn't run away that time.

00:26:10.330 --> 00:26:12.280
I didn't run away but turned back...

00:26:19.090 --> 00:26:20.650
<i>Miyu...</i>

00:26:21.130 --> 00:26:25.770
<i>It was Miyu, she was there that time too...</i>

00:26:28.470 --> 00:26:31.190
<i>and looking the same as she does now...</i>
